<tt xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.360"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">不是谎言，啊啊，那首初识时的歌。</text><text for="L2">至今仍会回想起。</text><text for="L3">那任性的暗号“ ”，我总会哼起，已经成了习惯。</text><text for="L4">在空想里偷偷逃课。</text><text for="L5">动弹不得、连学校也不去的日常，</text><text for="L6">无可比拟，沉浸其中的刹那自有价值。</text><text for="L7">你入睡的时候，我却清醒着。</text><text for="L8">为了想见你，我们彼此磨合。</text><text for="L9">别再一味数着彼此错开的习惯了。</text><text for="L10">把我的裂痕和你的日日（以注释或排版保留“ヒビ／日々”的同音双关），</text><text for="L11">发明一种把我的裂痕和你的日日编织在一起的办法。</text><text for="L12">在断线之前，还能传达给你。</text><text for="L13">现在有时间吗？大概没有吧。</text><text for="L14">那首与我擦肩而过的初识之歌，</text><text for="L15">至今仍会回想起。</text><text for="L16">那任性的暗号“ ”，</text><text for="L17">能这样哼起它，已经不再是谎言。</text><text for="L18">不是谎言，并非一瞬的闪耀，</text><text for="L19">把它说成幻影，是过于轻易的表达。</text><text for="L20">别说出那任性的暗号“再见”。</text><text for="L21">别在意啊，我又在嘟囔，已经蒙混不过去了。</text><text for="L22">全看你了，我只能说出这点无聊的期待。</text><text for="L23">消逝的瞬间，确是真切的。</text><text for="L24">觉得舒服吗？还是无所谓？</text><text for="L25">若一切到了最后都无需负责，</text><text for="L26">就连刚煮好的米饭也是如此，</text><text for="L27">对我而言，都是奢侈的事情。</text><text for="L28">在这暧昧的时代，为了让自己好起来，</text><text for="L29">想施个让自己好起来的咒，也想化作尸体（保留“おまじないしたい／死体”的双读）。</text><text for="L30">赶紧，迈向下一步。</text><text for="L31">只要想着“自己选！”，便有胜算。</text><text for="L32">那首与我擦肩而过、猝然的离别之歌，</text><text for="L33">至今仍会回想起。</text><text for="L34">那任性的暗号“ ”，</text><text for="L35">能这样哼起它，已经不再是谎言。</text><text for="L36">不是谎言，并非一瞬的闪耀，</text><text for="L37">那阵太过重大、盲目而怯懦的风，</text><text for="L38">温吞得仿佛就要腐烂。</text><text for="L39">量产化＝敌对。</text><text for="L40">你的关照就免了，我才不要呢。</text><text for="L41">偷偷练习，没问题。</text><text for="L42">可就是迟迟开始不了。</text><text for="L43">堂堂正正，撤回前言。</text><text for="L44">偏见真烦，“那”＝“邪”。</text><text for="L45">把它化作现实，再彻底砸碎它。</text><text for="L46">我知道，我知道。</text><text for="L47">双手冰冷，</text><text for="L48">那时我拼尽全力，也只能躲开。</text><text for="L49">虚无的理想，就是理想。</text><text for="L50">我根本不想妥协。</text><text for="L51">那首与我擦肩而过的初识之歌，</text><text for="L52">至今仍会回想起。</text><text for="L53">那任性的暗号“ ”，</text><text for="L54">能这样哼起它，已经不再是谎言。</text><text for="L55">不是谎言，并非一瞬的闪耀，</text><text for="L56">把它说成幻影，是过于轻易的表达。</text><text for="L57">别说出那任性的暗号“再见”。</text><text for="L58">别在意啊，我还在嘟囔，已经蒙混不过去了。</text><text for="L59">若不是你，未来便索然无味；我只能说这些。</text></translation></translations><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Truth in Lies"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Koke no ichinen Kaiba ni takusu - EP"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1770242100"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:18.633"><div begin="1.171" end="17.019" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="1.171" end="5.388" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.171" end="1.569">嘘</span><span begin="1.569" end="2.328">じゃない</span> <span begin="2.328" end="2.799">嗚呼</span> <span begin="2.799" end="3.881">初め</span><span begin="3.881" end="4.636">ましての</span><span begin="4.636" end="5.388">曲を</span></p><p begin="5.519" end="9.130" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.519" end="6.111">今も</span><span begin="6.111" end="6.738">まだ</span> <span begin="6.865" end="7.672">思い</span><span begin="7.672" end="8.223">返</span><span begin="8.223" end="9.130">します</span></p><p begin="9.167" end="17.019" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.167" end="10.654">我侭な</span><span begin="10.654" end="11.961">合言葉 " ”</span> <span begin="12.079" end="12.993">口ずさむ</span><span begin="12.993" end="13.755">習慣</span><span begin="13.755" end="14.283">な</span><span begin="14.283" end="14.654">ん</span><span begin="14.654" end="16.655">で</span><span begin="16.655" end="17.019">す</span></p></div><div begin="29.845" end="54.843" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.845" end="31.559" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.845" end="30.735">空想の</span><span begin="30.735" end="31.559">ずる休み</span></p><p begin="31.717" end="34.809" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.717" end="32.318">身動き</span><span begin="32.318" end="33.078">とれない</span> <span begin="33.078" end="34.060">不登校な</span><span begin="34.060" end="34.809">日常は</span></p><p begin="34.911" end="41.846" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.911" end="35.799">比べようも</span><span begin="35.799" end="36.248">なく</span> <span begin="36.248" end="37.642">浸</span><span begin="37.642" end="38.309">る</span><span begin="38.522" end="39.289">刹那に</span> <span begin="39.289" end="39.601">価</span><span begin="39.601" end="40.157">値</span><span begin="40.376" end="40.929">あ</span><span begin="40.929" end="41.846">り</span></p><p begin="42.686" end="45.929" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.686" end="43.534">君が</span><span begin="43.534" end="43.849">寝てる</span><span begin="43.849" end="44.310">時間</span> <span begin="44.557" end="45.066">私は</span><span begin="45.066" end="45.929">冴えてる</span></p><p begin="45.929" end="47.627" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.929" end="46.732">会いたいの</span><span begin="46.732" end="47.097">擦り合わ</span><span begin="47.097" end="47.627">せ</span></p><p begin="47.773" end="54.843" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.773" end="48.510">被らない</span><span begin="48.510" end="49.060">習慣</span><span begin="49.060" end="51.096">ばかり</span> <span begin="51.313" end="52.329">数えるの</span><span begin="52.329" end="53.720">やめ</span><span begin="53.720" end="54.843">よ</span></p></div><div begin="55.691" end="1:10.176" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="55.691" end="58.791" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.691" end="56.477">私の</span><span begin="56.477" end="57.057">ヒビ</span><span begin="57.057" end="57.353">と</span><span begin="57.481" end="58.109">君の</span><span begin="58.109" end="58.791">日々を</span></p><p begin="58.948" end="1:01.962" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.948" end="59.890">紡いで</span><span begin="59.890" end="1:00.565">ゆく</span><span begin="1:00.565" end="1:00.997">発</span><span begin="1:00.997" end="1:01.962">明</span></p><p begin="1:02.081" end="1:05.113" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.081" end="1:03.119">途切れてく</span><span begin="1:03.119" end="1:03.487">前</span><span begin="1:03.487" end="1:03.924">に</span><span begin="1:03.924" end="1:05.113">伝えられる</span></p><p begin="1:05.286" end="1:10.176" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.286" end="1:06.273">今時間</span><span begin="1:06.273" end="1:06.683">あ</span><span begin="1:06.683" end="1:07.699">る？</span> <span begin="1:08.283" end="1:08.895">ない</span><span begin="1:08.895" end="1:10.176">かな</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.840" end="1:49.638" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.840" end="1:14.781" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.840" end="1:11.351">すれ</span><span begin="1:11.351" end="1:11.903">違っ</span><span begin="1:11.903" end="1:12.312">た</span> <span begin="1:12.312" end="1:12.917">初</span><span begin="1:12.917" end="1:13.334">め</span><span begin="1:13.334" end="1:14.083">ましての</span><span begin="1:14.083" end="1:14.781">曲を</span></p><p begin="1:14.907" end="1:18.258" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.907" end="1:15.499">今も</span><span begin="1:15.499" end="1:15.958">まだ</span> <span begin="1:16.173" end="1:16.933">思い</span><span begin="1:16.933" end="1:17.361">返</span><span begin="1:17.361" end="1:18.258">します</span></p><p begin="1:18.241" end="1:20.501" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.241" end="1:19.738">我侭な</span><span begin="1:19.738" end="1:20.501">合言葉 " ”</span></p><p begin="1:20.501" end="1:23.593" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.501" end="1:21.532">口ずさむ</span><span begin="1:21.532" end="1:22.160">なんて</span> <span begin="1:22.160" end="1:22.510">もう</span><span begin="1:22.510" end="1:23.068">嘘</span><span begin="1:23.068" end="1:23.593">じゃない</span></p><p begin="1:23.700" end="1:27.551" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.700" end="1:24.676">嘘じゃない</span> <span begin="1:24.676" end="1:25.599">一瞬の</span><span begin="1:25.599" end="1:26.351">煌</span><span begin="1:26.351" end="1:26.662">めき</span><span begin="1:26.662" end="1:26.914">じゃ</span><span begin="1:26.914" end="1:27.551">なくて</span></p><p begin="1:27.748" end="1:31.061" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.748" end="1:28.852">幻じゃ</span><span begin="1:29.006" end="1:29.957">容易い</span><span begin="1:29.957" end="1:31.061">表現</span></p><p begin="1:31.121" end="1:36.559" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.121" end="1:32.500">我侭な</span><span begin="1:32.500" end="1:33.506">合言葉</span> <span begin="1:33.678" end="1:34.679">"さよなら”は</span><span begin="1:34.679" end="1:35.256">言わ</span><span begin="1:35.256" end="1:36.559">ないで</span></p><p begin="1:36.559" end="1:42.573" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.559" end="1:37.464">気にしない</span><span begin="1:37.464" end="1:37.995">でね</span> <span begin="1:38.126" end="1:38.521">また</span><span begin="1:38.521" end="1:39.644">ぼやいてる</span> <span begin="1:39.729" end="1:40.248">誤魔化</span><span begin="1:40.248" end="1:40.603">し</span><span begin="1:40.603" end="1:40.951">効か</span><span begin="1:40.951" end="1:41.929">な</span><span begin="1:41.929" end="1:42.573">い</span></p><p begin="1:42.882" end="1:49.638" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.882" end="1:44.233">君次第でね</span> <span begin="1:44.524" end="1:45.483">つまらない</span><span begin="1:45.483" end="1:46.152">期待</span> <span begin="1:46.158" end="1:46.916">それしか</span><span begin="1:46.916" end="1:47.281">言え</span><span begin="1:47.281" end="1:48.400">な</span><span begin="1:48.400" end="1:49.638">い</span></p></div><div begin="2:02.090" end="2:27.598" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:02.090" end="2:05.441" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.090" end="2:03.093">消えてゆく</span><span begin="2:03.093" end="2:04.083">瞬間は</span> <span begin="2:04.083" end="2:05.441">確かなり</span></p><p begin="2:05.529" end="2:07.067" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.529" end="2:06.298">心地いい？</span><span begin="2:06.298" end="2:07.067">関係ない？</span></p><p begin="2:07.067" end="2:09.102" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.067" end="2:07.711">最終は</span><span begin="2:07.711" end="2:08.633">無責任</span><span begin="2:08.633" end="2:09.102">なら</span></p><p begin="2:09.102" end="2:11.734" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.102" end="2:10.088">炊き立ての</span><span begin="2:10.088" end="2:10.536">ご飯</span><span begin="2:10.536" end="2:10.992">だっ</span><span begin="2:10.992" end="2:11.734">てそう</span></p><p begin="2:11.830" end="2:15.509" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.830" end="2:12.643">私に</span><span begin="2:12.643" end="2:13.414">とっては</span> <span begin="2:13.579" end="2:14.292">贅沢な</span><span begin="2:14.292" end="2:15.509">出来事です</span></p><p begin="2:15.509" end="2:18.673" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.509" end="2:16.973">曖昧時代</span> <span begin="2:17.301" end="2:17.899">大丈夫に</span><span begin="2:17.899" end="2:18.673">なるための</span></p><p begin="2:18.673" end="2:20.320" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.673" end="2:19.455">おまじない</span><span begin="2:19.455" end="2:20.320">死体</span></p><p begin="2:20.491" end="2:21.886" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.491" end="2:21.073">早急に</span> <span begin="2:21.073" end="2:21.886">その次</span></p><p begin="2:21.886" end="2:27.598" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.886" end="2:22.682">自分で</span><span begin="2:22.682" end="2:23.264">選</span><span begin="2:23.264" end="2:23.925">べっ！</span><span begin="2:24.071" end="2:24.354">と</span><span begin="2:24.354" end="2:25.020">思うなら</span> <span begin="2:25.020" end="2:25.521">勝</span><span begin="2:25.521" end="2:25.832">ち</span><span begin="2:25.832" end="2:27.598">あり</span></p></div><div begin="2:29.215" end="2:42.050" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:29.215" end="2:33.195" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.215" end="2:30.245">すれ違っ</span><span begin="2:30.245" end="2:30.681">た</span><span begin="2:30.681" end="2:31.697">呆気ない</span> <span begin="2:31.697" end="2:32.455">お別れの</span><span begin="2:32.455" end="2:33.195">曲を</span></p><p begin="2:33.289" end="2:36.640" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.289" end="2:33.881">今も</span><span begin="2:33.881" end="2:34.340">まだ</span> <span begin="2:34.555" end="2:35.315">思い</span><span begin="2:35.315" end="2:35.752">返</span><span begin="2:35.752" end="2:36.640">します</span></p><p begin="2:36.718" end="2:38.958" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.718" end="2:38.215">我侭な</span><span begin="2:38.215" end="2:38.958">合言葉 " ”</span></p><p begin="2:38.958" end="2:42.050" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.958" end="2:39.913">口ずさむ</span><span begin="2:39.913" end="2:40.579">なんて</span> <span begin="2:40.579" end="2:40.943">もう</span><span begin="2:40.943" end="2:41.525">嘘</span><span begin="2:41.525" end="2:42.050">じゃない</span></p></div><div begin="2:42.086" end="2:56.320" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:42.086" end="2:45.937" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.086" end="2:43.062">嘘じゃない</span> <span begin="2:43.062" end="2:43.985">一瞬の</span><span begin="2:43.985" end="2:44.656">煌</span><span begin="2:44.656" end="2:45.048">めき</span><span begin="2:45.048" end="2:45.300">じゃ</span><span begin="2:45.300" end="2:45.937">なくて</span></p><p begin="2:46.146" end="2:51.973" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.146" end="2:47.163">あまりにも</span><span begin="2:47.321" end="2:48.195">重大で</span><span begin="2:48.195" end="2:49.442">盲目</span> <span begin="2:49.